    ```hot
    ::channels ::discord::channels

    members ::channels/list-thread-members(::channels/ListThreadMembersRequest({
      channel_id: "1100000000000000000",
      with_member: true,
      limit: 100
    }))
    map(members, %.user_id)
    ```
    """
}
